  "coverage": [
    {
      "id": "block-001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source_line": 12,
      "original_text": "前不久，Anthropic 发布了 Claude Opus 5.5。因为它省 Token、指令遵循能力也很强，很多开发者拿它来写复杂代码和大型项目，评价甚高，甚至有人感叹那个熟悉的 Claude 又回来了。",
      "ranges": [
        {
          "slide": 1,
          "start": 0,
          "end": 103
        }
      ],
      "status": "complete"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source_line": 14,
      "original_text": "之后 Anthropic 紧接着推出了 Claude Sonnet 5.5。",
      "ranges": [
        {
          "slide": 2,
          "start": 0,
          "end": 38
        }
      ],
      "status": "complete"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source_line": 16,
      "original_text": "官方在发布公告里称：“单价与前代 Sonnet 5 相同，但单任务成本最高降低 30%，输出速度提升 30% 以上，是迄今最快的 Sonnet 模型。”",
      "ranges": [
        {
          "slide": 2,
          "start": 0,
          "end": 76
        }
      ],
      "status": "complete"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source_line": 18,
      "original_text": "不过我们在实际接入后发现了一个反常现象：在特定场景（尤其是高强度思考）下，单价更便宜的 Sonnet 5.5，最终跑完一个任务的开销，反而比顶级旗舰 Opus 5.5 还要贵。",
      "ranges": [
        {
          "slide": 2,
          "start": 0,
          "end": 88
        }
      ],
      "status": "complete"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source_line": 20,
      "original_text": "为什么单价便宜，做起事来反而可能更贵？两代 Sonnet 到底迭代了什么，与顶级旗舰 Opus 相比该如何抉择？",
      "ranges": [
        {
          "slide": 2,
          "start": 0,
          "end": 56
        }
      ],
      "status": "complete"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-006",
      "kind": "heading",
      "depth": 2,
      "source_line": 24,
      "original_text": "先看结论：核心规格与价格",
      "ranges": [
        {
          "slide": 2,
          "start": 0,
          "end": 12
        }
      ],
      "status": "complete"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source_line": 26,
      "original_text": "Claude Sonnet 5.5 定位是中端主力，主打速度快、单价便宜；Claude Opus 5.5 则是顶级旗舰，适合处理那些逻辑复杂、步骤多的大任务。",
      "ranges": [
        {
          "slide": 2,
          "start": 0,
          "end": 79
        }
      ],
      "status": "complete"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source_line": 28,
      "original_text": "Sonnet 5.5 与 Opus 5.5 的基础标称定价如下：",
      "ranges": [
        {
          "slide": 2,
          "start": 0,
          "end": 32
        }
      ],
      "status": "complete"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-009",
      "kind": "list",
      "source_line": 29,
      "original_text": "Sonnet 5.5：输入每百万 Token 2 美元，输出每百万 Token 10 美元（与前代 Sonnet 5 定价完全一致）；",
      "ranges": [
        {
          "slide": 2,
