          "end": 49
        }
      ],
      "status": "complete"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-031",
      "kind": "list",
      "source_line": 62,
      "original_text": "Sonnet 5.5：在 Claude Code 和 Claude.ai 网页端默认是 Medium（中度），但在直接调用 API 时默认是 High（高）；",
      "ranges": [
        {
          "slide": 12,
          "start": 0,
          "end": 79
        }
      ],
      "status": "complete"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-032",
      "kind": "list",
      "source_line": 63,
      "original_text": "Opus 5.5：默认则是 Medium。",
      "ranges": [
        {
          "slide": 12,
          "start": 0,
          "end": 21
        }
      ],
      "status": "complete"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source_line": 65,
      "original_text": "也就是说，如果你不做任何调整直接用默认配置拿 Sonnet 5.5 和 Opus 5.5 跑对比，实际上是在拿“全力思考的 Sonnet”去打“克制思考的 Opus”。",
      "ranges": [
        {
          "slide": 12,
          "start": 0,
          "end": 84
        }
      ],
      "status": "complete"
    },
    {
