          "end": 14
        }
      ],
      "status": "complete"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source_line": 95,
      "original_text": "纸面计算下，一笔包含 10 万输入 Token 和 2 万输出 Token 的常规请求，Sonnet 5.5 约花费 0.40 美元，Opus 5.5 约花费 0.80 美元，刚好就是半价。",
      "ranges": [
        {
          "slide": 17,
          "start": 0,
          "end": 95
        }
      ],
      "status": "complete"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source_line": 97,
      "original_text": "但一旦引入思考过程（Reasoning Tokens），就不一样了。",
      "ranges": [
        {
          "slide": 17,
          "start": 0,
          "end": 34
        }
      ],
      "status": "complete"
    },
    {
