    {
      "id": "block-051",
      "kind": "caption",
      "source_line": 102,
      "original_text": "Artificial Analysis 智能指数综合得分",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source_line": 104,
      "original_text": "Sonnet 5.5 拿下了 56 分，位列榜单第二，仅比 Opus 5.5 低 2 分，大幅超越了前代 Sonnet 5 的 38 分。",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source_line": 106,
      "original_text": "但细看单任务的实际花费：在高强度思考下，Sonnet 5.5 单任务成本甚至明显超过了 Opus 5.5。",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-054",
      "kind": "image",
      "source_line": 108,
      "original_text": "",
      "remote_url": "https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:2000/1*9nPMN7xjb4e_qY5DRMmFqg.png",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-055",
      "kind": "caption",
      "source_line": 109,
      "original_text": "Artificial Analysis 智能指数单任务成本实测",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-056",
      "kind": "image",
      "source_line": 111,
      "original_text": "",
      "remote_url": "https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:1400/1*8HPKtefvK1aGIIbGq-8kKg.png",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-057",
      "kind": "caption",
      "source_line": 112,
      "original_text": "Sonnet 5.5、Sonnet 5、Opus 5.5 与 GPT-6 系列单任务消耗与定价",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-058",
      "kind": "image",
      "source_line": 114,
      "original_text": "",
      "remote_url": "https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:1400/1*HKL0-erp-O-PzGEESFUW5A.png",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-059",
      "kind": "caption",
      "source_line": 115,
      "original_text": "单任务成本必须按目标质量分数看，而不是按档位标签看",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-060",
      "kind": "heading",
      "depth": 3,
      "source_line": 117,
      "original_text": "为什么单价便宜一半，干活反而更贵？",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source_line": 119,
      "original_text": "答案在思考过程产生的 Token 总量上。",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source_line": 121,
      "original_text": "在 Max 思考档位下，Sonnet 5.5 平均每个任务输出了大约 19.3 万个 Token，其中有 14.2 万个都是隐藏的推理思考 Token。相比之下，Opus 5.5 平均只用了 11.9 万个，前代 Sonnet 5 也只有 11.8 万个。",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source_line": 123,
      "original_text": "这是该机构有测试记录以来的最高输出量：比 Opus 5.5 多了近 60%，更是 GPT-6 Astra 的 7 倍。",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source_line": 125,
      "original_text": "单价再便宜，只要 Token 消耗量膨胀数倍，总账单自然就会超纲。在 Max 档位下，Sonnet 5.5 单任务平均花费约为 7.60 美元，不仅明显高于 Opus 5.5（约 5.98 美元），也比前代 Sonnet 5 贵了 50% 左右。",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source_line": 127,
      "original_text": "如果我们按照“达成同样的分数”来算账：",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-066",
      "kind": "list",
      "source_line": 128,
      "original_text": "目标 51~52 分：Sonnet 5.5 得开到 Xhigh 档；而 Opus 5.5 只要开在 Medium 档就能拿到 51 分，单任务成本只要 1.34 美元。",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-067",
      "kind": "list",
      "source_line": 129,
      "original_text": "目标 56 分的高质量：Opus 5.5 在 Xhigh 档花费 3.46 美元；而 Sonnet 5.5 开到 Max 档要花 7.60 美元以上，直接贵了一倍多。",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-068",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source_line": 131,
      "original_text": "虽然 Vals 在其自测任务集上给出了相反的比例（Sonnet 5.5 $20.80 vs Opus 5.5 $32.77，因为在他们的任务结构中思考 Token 膨胀没那么剧烈），但逻辑是一致的：Sonnet 5.5 并非在任何情况下都比 Opus 5.5 更省钱。它的成本优势只存在于低思考和中等思考强度；一旦你把它拉到 Max 试图硬顶出旗舰质量，往往反而比直接调用 Opus 5.5 更贵。",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-069",
      "kind": "heading",
      "depth": 2,
      "source_line": 135,
      "original_text": "思考档位：为什么别直接拉到最大？",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-070",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source_line": 137,
      "original_text": "官方技术文档里专门写了一句话：",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-071",
      "kind": "image",
      "source_line": 139,
      "original_text": "",
      "remote_url": "https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:1400/1*Vol0djUq02j3ErM_ZqV1rg.png",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-072",
      "kind": "quote",
      "source_line": 141,
      "original_text": "“Sonnet 5.5 的思考档位与 Sonnet 5 并不对等。请重新测试确定档位，不要直接照搬旧设置。” ",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source_line": 143,
      "original_text": "换句话说：Sonnet 5.5 的 Medium，并不等于前代 Sonnet 5 的 Medium。",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-074",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source_line": 145,
      "original_text": "Sonnet 5.5 在较低档位（如 Low 或 Medium）实际做出来的效果，就已经能赶上前代 Sonnet 5 在高档位的表现了。在 Low 档位下，整个测试仅耗费 2300 万 Token，得分也有 36 分。只有当你把档位往回调时，相比前代 Sonnet 5“节省 30%”的好处才能真正体现出来；如果你原样保留旧代码里的高档位甚至直接开到 Max，账单反而会上涨。",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-075",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source_line": 147,
      "original_text": "而且，思考档位拉得过高不仅花钱多，还容易出现“想得太多”的副作用：",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-076",
      "kind": "list",
      "source_line": 148,
      "original_text": "Simon Willison 的绘图测试：在 Max 档位下，Sonnet 5.5 消耗了 12.8 万 Token（约 1.28 美元），最后依然没画好“骑自行车的鹈鹕”；而在 Xhigh 档位下，只用了 41 秒、花费 6 美分就成功画出。",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-077",
      "kind": "list",
      "source_line": 149,
      "original_text": "FrontierCode 编程测试：Xhigh 档得分 52.1%，拉到 Max 反而掉到 46.2%，就是因为模型把太多精力浪费在拆分任务和子智能体调度上，反而容易把事情搞砸。",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-078",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source_line": 151,
      "original_text": "所以，日常使用建议从 Medium 或 High 开始尝试，不要盲目拉到 Max。",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-079",
      "kind": "heading",
      "depth": 2,
      "source_line": 155,
      "original_text": "速度与延迟：吐字快不等于干活快",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-080",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source_line": 157,
      "original_text": "Anthropic 官方表示 Sonnet 5.5 的输出速度比前代 Sonnet 5 提升了 30% 以上。根据 Artificial Analysis 的实测，Sonnet 5.5 的吐字速度大约是每秒 85 至 139 个 Token，而 Opus 5.5 是每秒 74 至 93 个 Token。",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source_line": 159,
      "original_text": "但要分清一点：吐字速度快，不代表任务能更快完成。因为在高强度思考下，Sonnet 5.5 往往会产生多得多的思考文本，即便每秒流速更快，最终等它完整输出的总耗时也可能更长。",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-082",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source_line": 161,
      "original_text": "Sonnet 5.5 与 Opus 5.5 在实际使用体验上还有一个明显区别：",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-083",
      "kind": "list",
      "source_line": 162,
      "original_text": "Opus 5.5：思考机制是底层常驻的，无法手动关闭；",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-084",
      "kind": "list",
      "source_line": 163,
      "original_text": "Sonnet 5.5：允许关闭前置思考。如果你的产品是在线客服、即时聊天等看重首字弹出时间（TTFT）的工具，关闭前置思考的 Sonnet 5.5 能做到秒回。",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-085",
      "kind": "heading",
      "depth": 2,
      "source_line": 167,
      "original_text": "接入接口要注意什么？几个容易踩坑的变化",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-086",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source_line": 169,
      "original_text": "如果你是在 API 上做开发的工程师，在从旧版 Sonnet 5 切换到 Sonnet 5.5 前，有几项改动需要特别留意，避免线上报错：",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-087",
      "kind": "image",
      "source_line": 171,
      "original_text": "",
      "remote_url": "https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:1400/1*9gzqeDGhJUXFvfNPDjxTxw.png",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-088",
      "kind": "list",
      "source_line": 173,
      "original_text": "不能直接关闭思考功能在 Sonnet 5.5 上，向接口传入 thinking: {&quot;type&quot;: &quot;disabled&quot;} 会直接返回 400 报错。现在最低的选项是 between_tools，它只在会话最开始跳过前置思考。",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-089",
      "kind": "list",
      "source_line": 175,
      "original_text": "移除了强制工具调用（Forced Tool Use）Sonnet 5.5 不再支持把 tool_choice 指定为 any 或具体工具名，现在只接受 auto 或 none。如果之前你的代码依赖强制调用某工具来稳定吐出 JSON，需要做相应调整。",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-090",
      "kind": "list",
      "source_line": 177,
      "original_text": "工具间的进度文本可能拿不到两次工具调用之间较长的推理说明，现在会被归入思考块（Thinking Blocks）。而在默认设置下这些思考块对外是空白的。程序不会崩，但如果你的产品界面原本依赖这些中间文字做进度提示，看起来会像是卡住了一样。",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-091",
      "kind": "list",
      "source_line": 179,
      "original_text": "思考过程不能跨模型流转，长任务别中途换模型如果想在同一轮会话里把 Sonnet 5.5 换成 Opus 5.5，虽然接口不会报错，但前一个模型的思考块会被直接丢弃。新模型看不到之前的推理脉络，只能按对话表面重新接话。Opus 5.5 看不懂 Sonnet 5.5 的思考块，Sonnet 5.5 也看不懂 Opus 5.5 的。因此对于连续的大任务，最好自始至终固定使用同一个模型。",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-092",
      "kind": "list",
      "source_line": 181,
      "original_text": "思考块严格绑定账号（防蒸馏保护）思考块只能在生成它的同一个账号内有效，而且只要修改了上文消息就无法复用。Sonnet 5.5 专门增加了分类器，用来拦截抓取思考过程训练其他模型的行为，还新增了 frontier_llm 状态码，直接拒绝可能辅助训练竞品模型的请求。",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-093",
      "kind": "list",
      "source_line": 183,
      "original_text": "网络安全审查会自动降级回退如果请求被判定具有高危安全漏洞利用风险，Sonnet 5.5 会自动回退到旧版 Sonnet 5 处理，Opus 5.5 则会回退到 Opus 4.8。普通的 Bug 修复不受影响，但在安全相关业务上要留意这一机制。",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-094",
      "kind": "list",
      "source_line": 185,
      "original_text": "对事实严谨度要求高的场景要多留心在 Artificial Analysis 的全知评测（Omniscience）中，Opus 5.5 的事实准确率为 66%，Sonnet 5.5 则是 54%。虽然 Sonnet 5.5 的幻觉率测出来是 47%（低于 Opus 5.5 的 59%），但如果是严谨的事实问答或严肃业务，对 Sonnet 5.5 的输出依然建议加上二次核对。",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-095",
      "kind": "list",
      "source_line": 187,
      "original_text": "轻量级 Haiku 5.5 即将推出如果是超大规模、低成本敏感的任务，可以稍等几周，更轻巧的 Haiku 5.5 即将推出。",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-096",
      "kind": "heading",
      "depth": 2,
      "source_line": 192,
      "original_text": "怎么选：三款模型各自适合什么场景？",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-097",
      "kind": "image",
      "source_line": 194,
      "original_text": "",
      "remote_url": "https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:1400/1*VNVwnWf_gdOmYlSRJrf8rQ.jpeg",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-098",
      "kind": "caption",
      "source_line": 195,
      "original_text": "面对长程复杂任务，旗舰模型的持续推断力依然最稳",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-099",
      "kind": "image",
      "source_line": 197,
      "original_text": "",
      "remote_url": "https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:1400/1*DLccAPNc1EtatPaS1nJS5Q.jpeg",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-100",
      "kind": "caption",
      "source_line": 198,
      "original_text": "在中等范围工程与创意落地中，Sonnet 5.5 展现出极高的性价比",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-101",
      "kind": "heading",
      "depth": 3,
      "source_line": 200,
      "original_text": "什么时候该从 Sonnet 5 升级到 Sonnet 5.5？",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-102",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source_line": 202,
      "original_text": "对于现有的 Sonnet 5 用户来说，只要注意调准思考档位，可以直接升级到 Sonnet 5.5：",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-103",
      "kind": "list",
      "source_line": 203,
      "original_text": "单价完全一致，但上下文窗口从 200K 跃升到了 1M；",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-104",
      "kind": "list",
      "source_line": 204,
      "original_text": "输出速度提升了 30% 以上；",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-105",
      "kind": "list",
      "source_line": 205,
      "original_text": "在完成同一任务时表达更加精炼，往往能少用 20%~30% 的 Token；",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-106",
      "kind": "list",
      "source_line": 206,
      "original_text": "Anthropic 还把 Sonnet 5.5 设为了免费网页端的新默认模型。对于绝大多数中小型项目和日常任务，Sonnet 5.5 完全可以平替前代 Sonnet 5。",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-107",
      "kind": "heading",
      "depth": 3,
      "source_line": 208,
      "original_text": "什么时候应该直接用 Opus 5.5？",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-108",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source_line": 210,
      "original_text": "Anthropic 官方的态度很直接：面对目标开放、高度依赖持续推导和连贯判断的复杂任务，Opus 5.5 的优势依然无法替代。",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-109",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source_line": 212,
      "original_text": "官方公布的两个案例很典型：",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-110",
      "kind": "list",
      "source_line": 213,
      "original_text": "一个测试团队让它在不到 3 小时内，对一个 20 万行代码的大型项目做完了全量审计和修 Bug；",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-111",
      "kind": "list",
      "source_line": 214,
      "original_text": "另一个团队让它在完全无人的情况下，跨 6 个核心代码仓库连续自主跑了 18 个多小时。",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-112",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source_line": 216,
      "original_text": "如果你要进行系统底层架构设计、多文件联动的全局大重构、或者追查非常隐蔽的复杂链路 Bug，Opus 5.5 是最安全稳健的选择。在这些场景里，做错一次的修复成本，远比省下的 Token 贵得多。",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-113",
      "kind": "heading",
      "depth": 3,
      "source_line": 218,
      "original_text": "什么时候选 Sonnet 5.5 代替 Opus 5.5？",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-114",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source_line": 220,
      "original_text": "Claude Code 的创造者 Boris Cherny 曾对比过两代 Sonnet 修复同一个 Bug 的表现，Sonnet 5.5 在精准度和响应速度上都有显著进步。",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-115",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source_line": 222,
      "original_text": "除了日常的代码修改与功能开发，Sonnet 5.5 在做动效设计、SVG 绘图和前端界面布局时，上手体验也相当不错：",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-116",
      "kind": "list",
      "source_line": 223,
      "original_text": "开发者 Kevin Ngo 分享过他用 Sonnet 5.5 制作 JavaScript 动效的经历，平均只要 3 到 4 次迭代就能做出高质量成果。",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-117",
      "kind": "list",
      "source_line": 224,
      "original_text": "他的用法很值得参考：“让 Opus 5.5 负责规划架构并制定创意方向，再交由 Sonnet 5.5 负责具体的编码与落地实现。” 这个组合既利用了 Opus 5.5 的宏观判断力，又享受了 Sonnet 5.5 便宜一半的执行成本，效果非常理想。",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-118",
      "kind": "list",
      "source_line": 225,
      "original_text": "此外，CodeRabbit 计划将常规代码审查转移至 Sonnet 5.5；Base44 报告构建应用的原型迭代次数相比 Opus 5 减少了近一半；Unity 则在编辑器评测中取得了 90% 的高任务完成率。",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-119",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source_line": 227,
      "original_text": "综合写代码的选型建议很清晰：对于边界清晰的日常开发、单文件修改、测试用例补全和常规 Bug 修复，Sonnet 5.5 的质量非常接近旗舰，且单价只有 Opus 5.5 的一半，是绝对的首选；而对于宏观架构设计、底层大版本迁移和棘手的排错，交给 Opus 5.5 更稳妥。",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-120",
      "kind": "heading",
      "depth": 2,
      "source_line": 231,
      "original_text": "顺便聊聊：便宜的国产与开源模型怎么看？",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-121",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source_line": 233,
      "original_text": "在讨论 Sonnet 5.5 定价时，Hacker News 上也有不少人提出：现在 DeepSeek V4 Flash、GLM-5.3 这类模型价格极低，Sonnet 5.5 的性价比真的有那么高吗？",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-122",
      "kind": "image",
      "source_line": 235,
      "original_text": "",
      "remote_url": "https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:1400/1*08966PBWn7Jjpbszx6PIww.png",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-123",
      "kind": "caption",
      "source_line": 236,
      "original_text": "社区用户关于高性价比模型的讨论",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-124",
      "kind": "image",
      "source_line": 238,
      "original_text": "",
      "remote_url": "https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:1400/1*4Gr0DvJHYftGE6pQdpRM8Q.png",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-125",
      "kind": "caption",
      "source_line": 239,
      "original_text": "关于开源/区域模型与顶级闭源模型定位的探讨",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-126",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source_line": 241,
      "original_text": "确实，在中等难度的日常需求里，很多国产和开源模型已经足够好用，价格也更低。但工程选型必须算总账。",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-127",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source_line": 243,
      "original_text": "比如 TokenCost 实测过 GLM-5.3 的账单，发现它在某些任务里吐出的 Token 数量是同类模型平均值的 2.4 倍。虽然每百万 Token 标价极低，但写出来的字数一多，最终账单同样会被拉高，这和 Sonnet 5.5 在高思考强度下的道理是一样的。",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-128",
      "kind": "heading",
      "depth": 2,
      "source_line": 247,
      "original_text": "推荐的日常分工策略",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-129",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source_line": 249,
      "original_text": "结合 Sonnet 5.5 与 Opus 5.5 的真实特性，推荐在日常项目中采用一套简单的 5 步分工策略：",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-130",
      "kind": "list",
      "source_line": 251,
      "original_text": "默认用 Sonnet 5.5 起步：常规日常任务默认接入 Sonnet 5.5（平替前代 Sonnet 5）。针对需求明确的 Agent 工具调用设为 Medium 档位，一般编码任务设为 High 档位。",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-131",
      "kind": "list",
      "source_line": 252,
      "original_text": "设立自动化检查门禁：通过单元测试、Schema 校验或自动打分工具把关，一旦结果不符合预期就自动拦截。",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-132",
      "kind": "list",
      "source_line": 253,
      "original_text": "梯次升级，不要盲目拉满：当任务初次失败时，直接将问题升级给处于 Medium 档位的 Opus 5.5，而不是盲目把 Sonnet 5.5 强行开到 Max 档死磕。",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-133",
      "kind": "list",
      "source_line": 254,
      "original_text": "复杂核心任务一开始就上 Opus 5.5：对于目标模糊、涉及跨多个代码库、或者一旦做错代价很大的核心任务，不要走前置试探，从一开始就直连 Opus 5.5。",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-134",
      "kind": "list",
      "source_line": 255,
      "original_text": "拿自己的真实数据说话：持续跟踪任务成功率、单任务消耗的 Token、工具调用频次以及人工修复所花的时间。",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-135",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source_line": 257,
      "original_text": "别人的评测数据只是参考，只有自己项目里的真实监控，才能给出最准确的答案。",
      "ranges": [],
      "status": "not_reached"
    }
  ]
}